{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51820","headline":"汉武帝祈仙台（《三秦记》：「坊州桥山有汉武帝祈仙台，高百尺。」李钦止题诗云：） · 李钦止","name":"汉武帝祈仙台（《三秦记》：「坊州桥山有汉武帝祈仙台，高百尺。」李钦止题诗云：）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"四方祸结与兵连，海内空虚在末年。\n谩筑此台高百尺，不知何处有神仙。\n（《永乐大典》二六○四「台」字韵）（〖1〗李钦止，疑非唐人。\n《大典》殆据《类编长安志》卷三。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李钦止","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}